  "duration_s": 359.91,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国古代那些号称万夫莫开的逆天关隘，真正排第一的究竟是哪一座吗？有人说是山海关两下，第一关，老龙头伸进海里。有人说是嘉峪关天下第一雄关，名长城最西端错了，第一名，被公认为中国关隘的终极天花板。两千多年来，谁想从他身上身上跨过去，都得先问问自己命够不够硬。今天咱们就来盘点盘点中国古代十大超级逆天关隘。老规矩，开讲之前，劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第十名，娘子关在山西阳泉平定县、万里长城的第九关。这关最绝的是他的名字，一个关隘，用女人命名的全国找不出第二座。唐朝初年，李渊的三女儿平阳公主带着一支娘子军驻守在这里，平阳公主的部队打仗，比男人还狠。公主去世以后，老百姓为了纪念她，把这官叫娘子。官官城不大，箭在悬崖上牙，斗如刀削，东门南门两座关门，六百五十米。城墙一边是桃核，一边是绝壁。您说这是官还是给一个女人立的碑？第九名，紫金关在河北保定易县太行，扒着你的第七头辅音，这官最绝的是他见证了一个王朝的崩塌。一四四九年土木之变明英宗被瓦剌俘虏，瓦剌大军压着皇帝，回头攻打紫荆关守关的明君，因为兵力太分散，关口太多，守不过来。瓦剌人一冲就破了，紫荆关一破，北京门户大开，才有了后来的北京保卫战。于谦临危受命，守住了北京可紫金官的教训。明朝记了两百年，您说这是关还是王朝的生死门？第八名，友谊关在广西凭祥中越边境上，这官最绝的是他打了一场让中国人扬眉吐气的仗。一八八五年。法国人打过来了，占领了镇南关。七十三岁的老将冯子才抬着棺材上阵，在关前筑起一道长墙。法军攻上来冯子才手持大刀冲在最前面，两个儿子跟着他一起冲。清军一看，老将军都拼命了，人人争先，法军被打退，冯子才追出关外几十里，歼灭法军两千多人。这是鸦片战争以后，中国人第一次打败西方列强，您说这是官还是中国人挺直的腰杆？第七名，居庸关在北京昌平太行八十里的第八感。这关最绝的是他是北京城的北大门军官，一破北京就门户大开。所以从元朝开始，居庸关就修的跟铁桶一样，南北两个瓮城、城楼、笛、台、水门什么都有关。成修在一条四十里长的山谷中间，这条山谷叫关沟，两边全是悬崖，中间只有一条路人马只能排成一队走居庸关就卡在这条路上，关城后面还有上关下关几道防线，层层设防。关城中间还有一座云台汉白玉的石台。元朝修的门洞里刻着四大天王，像还有六种文字的经文，您个门洞里六种文字，您说这是关还是北京的北大门？第六名剑门关，您四穿广元剑隔县大剑山中间这关最绝的是他一夫当关万夫莫开。这话就是从这儿来的李白写的剑阁峥嵘。而崔为一夫当关万夫莫开攻国的时候，诸葛亮在这修了官。后来，姜维带着五万人守建门关，钟会带着十万魏军来攻攻了几个月攻不下来，钟会都想撤军了。可惜邓艾从阴平小道绕过去了，剑门关没破，蜀汉还是王了，可剑门关没破，姜梅没输，您说这是官还是蜀汉最后的骨气？从第十到第六，娘子关是女人立的碑。紫荆关是王朝的生死门，有一冠是中国人挺直的腰杆。居庸关是北京的北大门，剑门关是蜀汉最后的骨气，可这五个还不是最逆天的。接下来第五到第一，一个比一个狠。有一座关，打了两千多年仗，有一座官天下第一关，还有一座关，两千三百年来，谁想从他身上过都得先留下一条命，他是哪？他凭什么排第一？下集马上更新，您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00001",
      "start_ms": 50,
      "end_ms": 4530,
      "text": "您知道中国古代那些号称万夫莫开的逆天关隘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5030,
      "end_ms": 8410,
      "text": "真正排第一的究竟是哪一座吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00003",
      "start_ms": 9010,
      "end_ms": 11530,
      "text": "有人说是山海关两下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00004",
      "start_ms": 11610,
      "end_ms": 12130,
      "text": "第一关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12450,
      "end_ms": 13970,
      "text": "老龙头伸进海里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00006",
      "start_ms": 14450,
      "end_ms": 18110,
      "text": "有人说是嘉峪关天下第一雄关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18510,
      "end_ms": 21530,
      "text": "名长城最西端错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22190,
      "end_ms": 22830,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23190,
      "end_ms": 26670,
      "text": "被公认为中国关隘的终极天花板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27430,
      "end_ms": 28710,
      "text": "两千多年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28970,
      "end_ms": 31060,
      "text": "谁想从他身上身上跨过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00012",
      "start_ms": 31520,
      "end_ms": 34360,
      "text": "都得先问问自己命够不够硬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00013",
      "start_ms": 34960,
      "end_ms": 41720,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点盘点中国古代十大超级逆天关隘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00014",
      "start_ms": 41820,
      "end_ms": 42440,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00015",
      "start_ms": 42780,
      "end_ms": 43700,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43780,
      "end_ms": 46740,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47180,
      "end_ms": 49260,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50380,
      "end_ms": 51060,
      "text": "第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00019",
      "start_ms": 51440,
      "end_ms": 57460,
      "text": "娘子关在山西阳泉平定县、万里长城的第九关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00020",
      "start_ms": 57940,
      "end_ms": 60865,
      "text": "这关最绝的是他的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00021",
      "start_ms": 61840,
      "end_ms": 62725,
      "text": "一个关隘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00022",
      "start_ms": 63600,
      "end_ms": 67045,
      "text": "用女人命名的全国找不出第二座。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00023",
      "start_ms": 67350,
      "end_ms": 68325,
      "text": "唐朝初年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00024",
      "start_ms": 68630,
      "end_ms": 73615,
      "text": "李渊的三女儿平阳公主带着一支娘子军驻守在这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00025",
      "start_ms": 73940,
      "end_ms": 76130,
      "text": "平阳公主的部队打仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00026",
      "start_ms": 76130,
      "end_ms": 77025,
      "text": "比男人还狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00027",
      "start_ms": 77630,
      "end_ms": 78830,
      "text": "公主去世以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00028",
      "start_ms": 79030,
      "end_ms": 80410,
      "text": "老百姓为了纪念她，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00029",
      "start_ms": 80510,
      "end_ms": 81770,
      "text": "把这官叫娘子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00030",
      "start_ms": 81770,
      "end_ms": 84195,
      "text": "官官城不大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00031",
      "start_ms": 85020,
      "end_ms": 87120,
      "text": "箭在悬崖上牙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00032",
      "start_ms": 87160,
      "end_ms": 88475,
      "text": "斗如刀削，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00033",
      "start_ms": 89250,
      "end_ms": 91395,
      "text": "东门南门两座关门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00034",
      "start_ms": 91720,
      "end_ms": 92580,
      "text": "六百五十米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00035",
      "start_ms": 92580,
      "end_ms": 95080,
      "text": "城墙一边是桃核，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00036",
      "start_ms": 95340,
      "end_ms": 96505,
      "text": "一边是绝壁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00037",
      "start_ms": 96970,
      "end_ms": 99475,
      "text": "您说这是官还是给一个女人立的碑？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00038",
      "start_ms": 100140,
      "end_ms": 100805,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00039",
      "start_ms": 101360,
      "end_ms": 104740,
      "text": "紫金关在河北保定易县太行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00040",
      "start_ms": 104820,
      "end_ms": 107800,
      "text": "扒着你的第七头辅音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00041",
      "start_ms": 108370,
      "end_ms": 112245,
      "text": "这官最绝的是他见证了一个王朝的崩塌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00042",
      "start_ms": 112930,
      "end_ms": 117985,
      "text": "一四四九年土木之变明英宗被瓦剌俘虏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00043",
      "start_ms": 118270,
      "end_ms": 119890,
      "text": "瓦剌大军压着皇帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00044",
      "start_ms": 120050,
      "end_ms": 123085,
      "text": "回头攻打紫荆关守关的明君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00045",
      "start_ms": 123440,
      "end_ms": 124755,
      "text": "因为兵力太分散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00046",
      "start_ms": 125020,
      "end_ms": 125860,
      "text": "关口太多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00047",
      "start_ms": 126080,
      "end_ms": 126895,
      "text": "守不过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00048",
      "start_ms": 127520,
      "end_ms": 129645,
      "text": "瓦剌人一冲就破了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00049",
      "start_ms": 129960,
      "end_ms": 131025,
      "text": "紫荆关一破，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00050",
      "start_ms": 131400,
      "end_ms": 132695,
      "text": "北京门户大开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00051",
      "start_ms": 133150,
      "end_ms": 135975,
      "text": "才有了后来的北京保卫战。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00052",
      "start_ms": 136720,
      "end_ms": 138565,
      "text": "于谦临危受命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00053",
      "start_ms": 138890,
      "end_ms": 141535,
      "text": "守住了北京可紫金官的教训。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00054",
      "start_ms": 141970,
      "end_ms": 143495,
      "text": "明朝记了两百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00055",
      "start_ms": 143950,
      "end_ms": 147315,
      "text": "您说这是关还是王朝的生死门？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00056",
      "start_ms": 147880,
      "end_ms": 148515,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00057",
      "start_ms": 148840,
      "end_ms": 154425,
      "text": "友谊关在广西凭祥中越边境上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00058",
      "start_ms": 155220,
      "end_ms": 160560,
      "text": "这官最绝的是他打了一场让中国人扬眉吐气的仗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00059",
      "start_ms": 160640,
      "end_ms": 161515,
      "text": "一八八五年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00060",
      "start_ms": 161880,
      "end_ms": 163155,
      "text": "法国人打过来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00061",
      "start_ms": 163590,
      "end_ms": 165125,
      "text": "占领了镇南关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00062",
      "start_ms": 165500,
      "end_ms": 169805,
      "text": "七十三岁的老将冯子才抬着棺材上阵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00063",
      "start_ms": 170440,
      "end_ms": 172665,
      "text": "在关前筑起一道长墙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00064",
      "start_ms": 173090,
      "end_ms": 177275,
      "text": "法军攻上来冯子才手持大刀冲在最前面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00065",
      "start_ms": 177690,
      "end_ms": 179895,
      "text": "两个儿子跟着他一起冲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00066",
      "start_ms": 180710,
      "end_ms": 181570,
      "text": "清军一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00067",
      "start_ms": 181850,
      "end_ms": 183510,
      "text": "老将军都拼命了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00068",
      "start_ms": 183670,
      "end_ms": 184625,
      "text": "人人争先，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00069",
      "start_ms": 184990,
      "end_ms": 186005,
      "text": "法军被打退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00070",
      "start_ms": 186330,
      "end_ms": 188585,
      "text": "冯子才追出关外几十里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00071",
      "start_ms": 189060,
      "end_ms": 191175,
      "text": "歼灭法军两千多人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00072",
      "start_ms": 192090,
      "end_ms": 193485,
      "text": "这是鸦片战争以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00073",
      "start_ms": 194170,
      "end_ms": 197015,
      "text": "中国人第一次打败西方列强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00074",
      "start_ms": 198480,
      "end_ms": 201485,
      "text": "您说这是官还是中国人挺直的腰杆？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00075",
      "start_ms": 201760,
      "end_ms": 202295,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00076",
      "start_ms": 203340,
      "end_ms": 209355,
      "text": "居庸关在北京昌平太行八十里的第八感。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00077",
      "start_ms": 209670,
      "end_ms": 213560,
      "text": "这关最绝的是他是北京城的北大门军官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00078",
      "start_ms": 213640,
      "end_ms": 216045,
      "text": "一破北京就门户大开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00079",
      "start_ms": 216840,
      "end_ms": 218265,
      "text": "所以从元朝开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00080",
      "start_ms": 218570,
      "end_ms": 220705,
      "text": "居庸关就修的跟铁桶一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00081",
      "start_ms": 221500,
      "end_ms": 227500,
      "text": "南北两个瓮城、城楼、笛、台、水门什么都有关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00082",
      "start_ms": 227500,
      "end_ms": 230785,
      "text": "成修在一条四十里长的山谷中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00083",
      "start_ms": 231510,
      "end_ms": 233425,
      "text": "这条山谷叫关沟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00084",
      "start_ms": 234010,
      "end_ms": 235425,
      "text": "两边全是悬崖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00085",
      "start_ms": 235860,
      "end_ms": 241880,
      "text": "中间只有一条路人马只能排成一队走居庸关就卡在这条路上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00086",
      "start_ms": 242980,
      "end_ms": 248240,
      "text": "关城后面还有上关下关几道防线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00087",
      "start_ms": 248520,
      "end_ms": 249600,
      "text": "层层设防。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00088",
      "start_ms": 250540,
      "end_ms": 254280,
      "text": "关城中间还有一座云台汉白玉的石台。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00089",
      "start_ms": 254600,
      "end_ms": 257440,
      "text": "元朝修的门洞里刻着四大天王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00090",
      "start_ms": 257440,
      "end_ms": 259960,
      "text": "像还有六种文字的经文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00091",
      "start_ms": 260760,
      "end_ms": 262460,
      "text": "您个门洞里六种文字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00092",
      "start_ms": 263200,
      "end_ms": 265760,
      "text": "您说这是关还是北京的北大门？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00093",
      "start_ms": 266260,
      "end_ms": 267980,
      "text": "第六名剑门关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00094",
      "start_ms": 269060,
      "end_ms": 279990,
      "text": "您四穿广元剑隔县大剑山中间这关最绝的是他一夫当关万夫莫开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00095",
      "start_ms": 280190,
      "end_ms": 284310,
      "text": "这话就是从这儿来的李白写的剑阁峥嵘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00096",
      "start_ms": 284390,
      "end_ms": 288770,
      "text": "而崔为一夫当关万夫莫开攻国的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00097",
      "start_ms": 288770,
      "end_ms": 290270,
      "text": "诸葛亮在这修了官。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00098",
      "start_ms": 290270,
      "end_ms": 290630,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00099",
      "start_ms": 290630,
      "end_ms": 294010,
      "text": "姜维带着五万人守建门关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00100",
      "start_ms": 294030,
      "end_ms": 300065,
      "text": "钟会带着十万魏军来攻攻了几个月攻不下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00101",
      "start_ms": 300740,
      "end_ms": 302225,
      "text": "钟会都想撤军了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00102",
      "start_ms": 303000,
      "end_ms": 306340,
      "text": "可惜邓艾从阴平小道绕过去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00103",
      "start_ms": 306340,
      "end_ms": 307555,
      "text": "剑门关没破，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00104",
      "start_ms": 307990,
      "end_ms": 309165,
      "text": "蜀汉还是王了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00105",
      "start_ms": 309540,
      "end_ms": 310805,
      "text": "可剑门关没破，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00106",
      "start_ms": 311080,
      "end_ms": 312015,
      "text": "姜梅没输，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00107",
      "start_ms": 312410,
      "end_ms": 315715,
      "text": "您说这是官还是蜀汉最后的骨气？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00108",
      "start_ms": 316190,
      "end_ms": 317630,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00109",
      "start_ms": 317750,
      "end_ms": 319925,
      "text": "娘子关是女人立的碑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00110",
      "start_ms": 320610,
      "end_ms": 322635,
      "text": "紫荆关是王朝的生死门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00111",
      "start_ms": 323310,
      "end_ms": 326075,
      "text": "有一冠是中国人挺直的腰杆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00112",
      "start_ms": 326780,
      "end_ms": 329215,
      "text": "居庸关是北京的北大门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00113",
      "start_ms": 330070,
      "end_ms": 332605,
      "text": "剑门关是蜀汉最后的骨气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00114",
      "start_ms": 333070,
      "end_ms": 335765,
      "text": "可这五个还不是最逆天的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00115",
      "start_ms": 336310,
      "end_ms": 337835,
      "text": "接下来第五到第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00116",
      "start_ms": 338250,
      "end_ms": 339265,
      "text": "一个比一个狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00117",
      "start_ms": 339560,
      "end_ms": 340495,
      "text": "有一座关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00118",
      "start_ms": 340870,
      "end_ms": 342290,
      "text": "打了两千多年仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00119",
      "start_ms": 342430,
      "end_ms": 344710,
      "text": "有一座官天下第一关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00120",
      "start_ms": 344930,
      "end_ms": 345925,
      "text": "还有一座关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00121",
      "start_ms": 346520,
      "end_ms": 348020,
      "text": "两千三百年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00122",
      "start_ms": 348020,
      "end_ms": 351625,
      "text": "谁想从他身上过都得先留下一条命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00123",
      "start_ms": 352520,
      "end_ms": 353120,
      "text": "他是哪？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00124",
      "start_ms": 353240,
      "end_ms": 354825,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00125",
      "start_ms": 355060,
      "end_ms": 356485,
      "text": "下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ff6e806d833b26e0_s00126",
      "start_ms": 356770,
      "end_ms": 359755,
      "text": "您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
